    {
      "text": "Summary of the global health sector strategy on viral hepatitis 2022–2030: its vision and goal, followed by indicators and their 2030 elimination targets, grouped into epidemic impact (incidence, prevalence, mortality) and service coverage (vaccination, diagnosis, treatment, harm reduction, blood and injection safety).",
